<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><title>Form 03</title><style>@page{size:A4;margin:10mm 12mm 16mm;@bottom-center{content:"Bloomwell Home Care Uganda Limited · Nest Mama Program · Page " counter(page) " of " counter(pages);font:7pt Arial,sans-serif;color:#47615E}}
*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:#0B2E2A;font-size:8.5pt;line-height:1.35}
.hd{background:#08675F;color:#fff;padding:3mm 5mm;border-bottom:1.4mm solid #F8991E}.hd table{width:100%}.hd td{vertical-align:middle}.hd .n{font-size:12pt;font-weight:bold}.hd .s{font-size:7pt;color:#CFEAE5}.hd .r{text-align:right;font-size:7pt;color:#CFEAE5}
.tt{border:.3mm solid #08675F;background:#DDF0EC;padding:2.5mm 3mm;margin:3mm 0}.tt b{font-size:12pt;color:#08675F}.tt div{font-size:7.5pt;color:#47615E;margin-top:1mm}
h3{font-size:9pt;color:#08675F;margin:4mm 0 1.5mm;border-bottom:.3mm solid #F8991E;padding-bottom:.8mm;break-after:avoid}
table.r{width:100%;border-collapse:separate;border-spacing:2mm 0;margin:0 -2mm}table.r{table-layout:fixed}
.c{vertical-align:bottom;padding-top:1.5mm}.l{display:block;font-size:6.8pt;color:#47615E}.v{display:block;border-bottom:.25mm solid #7F9A96;min-height:5.5mm;font-size:8.5pt;font-weight:bold}
.w{margin-top:1.5mm;break-inside:avoid}.w .v{border:.25mm solid #CAD9D5;border-bottom:.25mm solid #7F9A96;min-height:11mm;padding:1mm 1.5mm;font-weight:normal;background:#FBFDFC}
.cb{margin-top:1.8mm;break-inside:avoid}.cb .o{display:inline-block;margin:0 4mm 0 0;font-size:8.5pt}.cb .l{display:inline;margin-right:3mm;font-size:8pt;color:#0B2E2A;font-weight:bold}
.n{border:.3mm solid #E0B25A;background:#FFF6E3;padding:2mm 3mm;margin-top:2.5mm;font-size:7.8pt;break-inside:avoid}
p.t{margin:2mm 0;font-size:8.3pt;break-inside:avoid}
table.g{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin-top:2mm;table-layout:fixed;break-inside:avoid}.g th{background:#08675F;color:#fff;font-size:6.8pt;padding:1.4mm;text-align:left}.g td{border:.25mm solid #CAD9D5;height:7.5mm;padding:.5mm 1.5mm;font-size:8pt}.g tr:nth-child(even) td{background:#F2F8F6}
table.s{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin-top:3mm;table-layout:fixed;break-inside:avoid}.s th{background:#E8F2F0;font-size:6.8pt;text-align:left;padding:1.2mm;border:.25mm solid #CAD9D5}.s td{border:.25mm solid #CAD9D5;padding:1.2mm;vertical-align:top;height:15mm;font-size:7.8pt}
.s .m{font-size:6.8pt;line-height:1.5}.si{max-height:10mm;display:block}.ev{font-size:6pt;color:#47615E;margin-top:.8mm}
.idr{margin-top:1mm}thead{display:table-header-group}tr{break-inside:avoid}</style></head><body><div class="hd"><table><tr><td style="width:14mm">{{ org.mark_svg|safe }}</td><td><div class="n">BLOOMWELL HOME CARE UGANDA LIMITED</div><div class="s">Patient consent and care forms · Nest Mama Program · You rest, we care</div></td><td class="r">{{ org.city }}, Uganda<br>{{ org.phone }}</td></tr></table></div><div class="tt"><b>FORM 03. CONSENT TO THE AGREED NURSING CARE</b><div>Record informed consent to the overall care plan and who is lawfully entitled to decide. Completed before care starts and again on any material change. This is not consent to every future procedure; use Form 04 for specific procedures.</div></div><table class="r idr"><tr><td class="c"><span class="l">Patient full name</span><span class="v">{{ patient.name }}</span></td><td class="c"><span class="l">DOB / age</span><span class="v">{{ patient.dob }}</span></td><td class="c"><span class="l">Patient record ID</span><span class="v">{{ patient.record_id }}</span></td><td class="c"><span class="l">Date / time</span><span class="v">{{ form.datetime }}</span></td></tr></table><h3>The care being agreed</h3><div class="w"><span class="l">Care plan reference / version and proposed care</span><span class="v">{{ v.care_plan_reference_version_and_proposed or prefill.care_plan_reference_version_and_proposed }}</span></div><div class="w"><span class="l">Expected benefits, material risks and limitations discussed</span><span class="v">{{ v.expected_benefits_material_risks_and_lim or prefill.expected_benefits_material_risks_and_lim }}</span></div><div class="w"><span class="l">Reasonable alternatives, including no care, and likely consequences</span><span class="v">{{ v.reasonable_alternatives_including_no_car or prefill.reasonable_alternatives_including_no_car }}</span></div><div class="w"><span class="l">Questions, answers, patient preferences and limits on consent</span><span class="v">{{ v.questions_answers_patient_preferences_an or prefill.questions_answers_patient_preferences_an }}</span></div><h3>Who makes this decision</h3><div class="cb"><span class="l">Decision maker:</span><span class="o">{{ "☒" if v.decision_maker == "Patient decides for themselves" else "☐" }} Patient decides for themselves</span><span class="o">{{ "☒" if v.decision_maker == "Parent or person with lawful authority" else "☐" }} Parent or person with lawful authority</span></div><table class="r"><tr><td class="c"><span class="l">Decision-specific capacity assessed by</span><span class="v">{{ v.decision_specific_capacity_assessed_by or prefill.decision_specific_capacity_assessed_by }}</span></td><td class="c"><span class="l">Date / time</span><span class="v">{{ v.date_time or prefill.date_time }}</span></td></tr></table><div class="w"><span class="l">Support / interpreter provided and findings</span><span class="v">{{ v.support_interpreter_provided_and_finding or prefill.support_interpreter_provided_and_finding }}</span></div><div class="w"><span class="l">If the patient is under 18: parent or legal guardian, relationship and evidence of authority</span><span class="v">{{ v.if_the_patient_is_under_18_parent_or_leg or prefill.if_the_patient_is_under_18_parent_or_leg }}</span></div><div class="w"><span class="l">If another person signs: name, relationship, legal basis and evidence of authority</span><span class="v">{{ v.if_another_person_signs_name_relationshi or prefill.if_another_person_signs_name_relationshi }}</span></div><div class="w"><span class="l">Patient involvement or child assent where appropriate; concerns / disagreement</span><span class="v">{{ v.patient_involvement_or_child_assent_wher or prefill.patient_involvement_or_child_assent_wher }}</span></div><div class="n">Do not assume incapacity from disability, age or difficulty speaking. If authority or capacity is unclear, obtain clinical or legal guidance before non-urgent treatment. An emergency exception, if relied on, must be separately documented on Form 10.</div><h3>Patient or authorised representative declaration</h3><p class="t">The proposed care, its benefits, important risks, limitations and reasonable alternatives have been explained in a language I understand. I have had an opportunity to ask questions and received answers. I voluntarily agree only to the care recorded above and in the identified care plan. Material changes or additional procedures require a further consent discussion.</p><p class="t">I may refuse a proposed intervention or withdraw consent at any time. The clinician will explain the consequences and discuss safe alternatives. No particular outcome is guaranteed. My signature does not waive legal rights or release BLOOMWELL or its personnel from responsibility for negligent care. This is not consent for research, publicity or every future procedure.</p><h3>Signatures</h3><table class="s"><tr><th style="width:27mm">Role</th><th style="width:44mm">Name and details</th><th style="width:30mm">Method</th><th>Signature or thumbprint, with e-signature evidence</th><th style="width:24mm">Date / time</th></tr><tr><td><b>Patient or authorised representative</b><div class="m">{{ "☒" if sig.client.esign else "☐" }} I agree to sign electronically</div></td><td>{{ sig.client.name or patient.name }}<div class="m">Name, capacity / role</div><div>{{ sig.client.detail }}</div></td><td class="m">{{ "☒" if sig.client.method == "drawn" else "☐" }} Drawn<br>{{ "☒" if sig.client.method == "biometric" else "☐" }} Fingerprint / Face<br>{{ "☒" if sig.client.method == "password" else "☐" }} Passphrase<br>{{ "☒" if sig.client.method == "thumbprint" else "☐" }} Thumbprint<br></td><td>{% if sig.client.image %}<img class="si" src="{{ sig.client.image }}">{% endif %}<div class="ev">{{ sig.client.evidence }}</div></td><td>{{ sig.client.at }}</td></tr><tr><td><b>Interpreter or reader (if used)</b></td><td>{{ sig.interpreter.name }}<div class="m">Name, address, language</div><div>{{ sig.interpreter.detail }}</div></td><td class="m">{{ "☒" if sig.interpreter.method == "drawn" else "☐" }} Drawn<br>{{ "☒" if sig.interpreter.method == "biometric" else "☐" }} Fingerprint / Face<br>{{ "☒" if sig.interpreter.method == "password" else "☐" }} Passphrase<br>{{ "☒" if sig.interpreter.method == "thumbprint" else "☐" }} Thumbprint<br></td><td>{% if sig.interpreter.image %}<img class="si" src="{{ sig.interpreter.image }}">{% endif %}<div class="ev">{{ sig.interpreter.evidence }}</div></td><td>{{ sig.interpreter.at }}</td></tr><tr><td><b>Witness (recommended)</b></td><td>{{ sig.witness.name }}<div class="m">Name and role</div><div>{{ sig.witness.detail }}</div></td><td class="m">{{ "☒" if sig.witness.method == "drawn" else "☐" }} Drawn<br>{{ "☒" if sig.witness.method == "biometric" else "☐" }} Fingerprint / Face<br>{{ "☒" if sig.witness.method == "password" else "☐" }} Passphrase<br>{{ "☒" if sig.witness.method == "thumbprint" else "☐" }} Thumbprint<br></td><td>{% if sig.witness.image %}<img class="si" src="{{ sig.witness.image }}">{% endif %}<div class="ev">{{ sig.witness.evidence }}</div></td><td>{{ sig.witness.at }}</td></tr><tr><td><b>Clinician</b></td><td>{{ sig.nurse.name or author.name }}<div class="m">Name and UNMC number</div><div>{{ sig.nurse.detail or author.registration_line }}</div></td><td class="m">{{ "☒" if sig.nurse.method == "drawn" else "☐" }} Drawn<br>{{ "☒" if sig.nurse.method == "biometric" else "☐" }} Fingerprint / Face<br>{{ "☒" if sig.nurse.method == "password" else "☐" }} Account password<br></td><td>{% if sig.nurse.image %}<img class="si" src="{{ sig.nurse.image }}">{% endif %}<div class="ev">{{ sig.nurse.evidence }}</div></td><td>{{ sig.nurse.at }}</td></tr></table><table class="r"><tr><td class="c"><span class="l">Copy given on</span><span class="v">{{ v.copy_given_on or prefill.copy_given_on }}</span></td><td class="c"><span class="l">Sent by (auto-email / paper)</span><span class="v">{{ v.sent_by_auto_email_paper or prefill.sent_by_auto_email_paper }}</span></td><td class="c"><span class="l">Sent to (email)</span><span class="v">{{ v.sent_to_email or prefill.sent_to_email }}</span></td></tr></table></body></html>